    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">OUTPUT 1: 
BETTER CAPACITY AND SYSTEMS AND KNOWLEDGE IN PLACE TO INCREASE TRANSPARENCY AND ACCOUNTABILITY OF PUBLIC RESOURCE MANAGEMENT
1.1 Number of systems and digital solutions to increase transparency and accountability of public finance resource management created or strengthened, with TEA support 
1.2a Number of knowledge products developed to support improvements in accountable public resource management and enhance public awareness on issues related to TEA
1.2b Percentage of knowledge products developed that have an inclusivity focus.
1.4 Number of citizens visiting the public digital citizens budget website for a least one minute.
OUTPUT 2: 
STRENGTHENED CAPACITY AND KNOWLEDGE IN PLACE TO ENCOURAGE GREATER EQUITY, RESPONSIVENESS AND INTEGRITY OF PRIORITY PUBLIC SERVICES AND UTILITIES
2.1 Number of systems, mechanisms and digital solutions created to encourage greater equality, responsiveness and integrity of priority public services and utilities, with TEA support.
2.2a Number of knowledge products developed to support improvements in accountability and transparency in public services and utilities and enhance public awareness on issues related to TEA.
2.2b Percentage of knowledge products developed that have an inclusivity focus.</narrative>
    </description>
